<%- include('partials/header') %>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/volunteer.css">

<main class="kits-at-home-layout">
  <%- include('partials/volunteerSideMenu') %>

  <div class="kits-at-home-page">

    <section class="kah-intro">
      <p class="kah-label">VOLUNTEER</p>
      <h1>KITS AT HOME</h1>
      <h2>Pack a Kit. Change a life.</h2>

      <p>
        Every day, women around the world give birth without access to clean, safe medical supplies.
        You can help change that, right from your kitchen table.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Kits at Home</strong> is a hands-on activity you can do on your own or with family,
        friends, or your community, and is a beautiful way to create something that saves lives.
        We provide all the materials and easy-to-follow instructions, and distribute the results
        where they are needed the most.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>
          The cost of this activity is AUD $600 for 100 kits, for which you will receive a
          tax-deductible donation receipt.
        </strong>
      </p>

      <p>
        Our Clean Birth Kits are simple, low-cost, and life-saving. Featuring a few simple resources,
        they help prevent infection and complications during childbirth in places where medical care
        is limited or unavailable.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="kah-two-column">
      <div class="kah-image-box">
        <img src="/images/clean-birth-kits/BKFA-kit-contents-web-720x800.jpg">     
      </div>

      <div class="kah-text">
        <h2>What’s in a Clean Birth Kit?</h2>
        <p>Each kit contains sterile items designed to support a safe delivery:</p>

        <ul>
          <li>1 biodegradable green plastic sheet (1m x 1m)</li>
          <li>1 bar of wrapped soap</li>
          <li>2 pairs of gloves</li>
          <li>3 x 24cm lengths of string</li>
          <li>1 sterile scalpel blade (wrapped)</li>
          <li>5 gauze squares</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          All kits are packed into a small biodegradable bag—because helping people shouldn’t harm
          the planet.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="kah-two-column kah-two-column-reverse">
      <div class="kah-text">
        <h2>An ideal activity for:</h2>

        <ul>
          <li><strong>Family gatherings</strong> – celebrate a mother or baby with your loved ones.</li>
          <li><strong>Social clubs</strong> – easily completed around the dining table with plenty of chance to chat!</li>
          <li><strong>Aged care homes and retirement communities</strong> – boost connection and engagement for residents.</li>
          <li><strong>Youth and faith groups</strong> – raise awareness for social justice issues.</li>
          <li><strong>Cosy winter nights</strong> in with a podcast, audio book or Netflix on the side!</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          If you can work at a table you can pack clean birth kits. This activity is suitable for
          children too, aged 10 and up with adult supervision.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="kah-image-box">
        <img src="/images/clean-birth-kits/BKFA-community-AD-feb-7631-720x960.jpg" alt="Volunteer packing kits">      
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="kah-booking">
      <h2>How to book your Kits at Home event:</h2>

      <ol>
        <li>Round up a group of keen participants.</li>
        <li>Select a date at least 4 weeks away to allow time for shipping the supplies.</li>
        <li>Complete the order form below and make payment for your kits.</li>
        <li>We’ll deliver the supplies ready to pack, and provide plenty of instructions.</li>
        <li>When your kits are complete, let us know and we’ll arrange collection from you.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="kah-giving">
      <h2>100% Tax Deductible Giving</h2>

      <p>
        Your participation is not only impactful but also 100% tax deductible, as your donation goes
        directly toward BKFA’s programs. So while you’re creating a powerful impact, you’ll also enjoy
        a financial benefit for your support.
      </p>

      <hr>

      <p>
        Click the button below to view our information pack. Then, simply fill in the form below and
        make your tax deductible donation via credit card to participate in “Kits at Home”.
      </p>

      <p>
        If you are interested in packing a different number of kits than the quantities we have
        available, please contact us via email <a href="mailto:info@bkfa.org.au">info@bkfa.org.au</a>.
      </p>

      <a
        class="kah-info-pack"
        href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wy4rtMahZGLBXRzwQDJWho951q_qFV8d/view?usp=sharing"
        target="_blank"
      >
        KITS AT<br>
        HOME INFO<br>
        PACK
      </a>
    </section>

    <section class="kah-form-section">
      <div class="kah-form-container">
        <h2>PACK KITS AT HOME</h2>
        <h3>Kits at Home 2025/26</h3>

        <form class="kah-form">
          <label>Date of your planned kit assembly (approx)</label>
          <input type="text">

          <h3>Volunteer Information</h3>

          <div class="kah-form-row">
            <div>
              <label>First Name *</label>
              <input type="text">
            </div>

            <div>
              <label>Last Name *</label>
              <input type="text">
            </div>
          </div>

          <label>No. of people helping to pack kits at home *</label>
          <input type="text">

          <p class="kah-form-note">*Disposable gloves are supplied for all volunteers</p>

          <label>Home Address (Note: no PO Boxes) *</label>
          <input type="text">

          <label>Street Address</label>
          <input type="text">

          <div class="kah-form-row">
            <div>
              <label>Address Line 2</label>
              <input type="text">
            </div>

            <div>
              <label>State / Province / Region</label>
              <input type="text">
            </div>
          </div>

          <label>City</label>
          <input type="text">

          <label>ZIP / Postal Code</label>
          <input type="text">

          <div class="kah-form-row">
            <div>
              <label>Mobile *</label>
              <input type="text">
            </div>

            <div>
              <label>Home Phone</label>
              <input type="text">
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="kah-form-row">
            <div>
              <label>Email *</label>
              <input type="email">
            </div>

            <div>
              <label>How did you hear about Kits at Home? *</label>
              <select>
                <option></option>
                <option>Website</option>
                <option>Social media</option>
                <option>Friend or family</option>
                <option>Other</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h3>Payment Information</h3>

          <p class="kah-payment-text">
            Kits at Home is a tax deductible activity and we will provide you with a receipt for your records.
          </p>

          <hr>

          <p>Total</p>
          <p class="kah-price">$ 600.00</p>

          <p class="kah-checkbox-heading">
            Thank you for supporting Kits at Home. Please check the boxes below to acknowledge your acceptance of the conditions *
          </p>

          <div class="kah-checkboxes">
            <label><input type="checkbox"> <strong>Select All</strong></label>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> You agree to follow all hygiene and kit assembly instructions provided by BKFA</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> You will follow current government guidelines on social distancing at home</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> You will return completed kits to BKFA within 4 weeks</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> You agree to receive the BKFA newsletter, occasional appeals and general updates.</label>
          </div>

          <h3>Credit Card</h3>

          <div class="kah-stripe-box">
            <p class="kah-secure-payment">
              🔒 Secure, fast checkout with Link
            </p>

            <div class="kah-credit-grid">
              <div class="kah-card-number">
                <label>Card number</label>
                <input type="text" placeholder="1234 1234 1234 1234">
              </div>

              <div>
                <label>Expiration date</label>
                <input type="text" placeholder="MM / YY">
              </div>

              <div>
                <label>Security code</label>
                <input type="text" placeholder="CVC">
              </div>
            </div>

            <label>Country</label>
            <select>
              <option>Australia</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div class="kah-captcha">
            <h3>CAPTCHA</h3>

            <div class="kah-captcha-box">
              <div class="kah-checkbox"></div>
              <span>I’m not a robot</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="kah-submit">
            Submit
          </button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>